  "description": "What the design is: A digital collection of 20 high-resolution watercolor-style illustrations featuring elegant pink royal floral elements, including ornate crowns, fairytale carriages, castles, dresses, floral wreaths, and bouquets.   Included file formats: High-resolution PNG files (300 DPI) with transparent backgrounds, optimized for digital crafting, professional printing, and cutting machines.   Potential use cases:Physical crafting and scrapbooking using Cricut and Silhouette cutting machines.   Sublimation printing for custom princess mugs, tumblers, water bottles, and royal home decor blanks.   Print-on-demand (POD) merchandise and commercial physical items for fairy tale apparel, boutique branding, and seasonal gift items.   Custom apparel creation for princess t-shirts, royal hoodies, canvas treat pouches, and custom party tote bags.   Princess event decor, royal birthday party invitations, greeting cards, wall art prints, and custom planner sticker designs.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>What the design is: A digital collection of 20 high-resolution watercolor-style illustrations featuring elegant pink royal floral elements, including ornate crowns, fairytale carriages, castles, dresses, floral wreaths, and bouquets.   Included file formats: High-resolution PNG files (300 DPI) with transparent backgrounds, optimized for digital crafting, professional printing, and cutting machines.   Potential use cases:Physical crafting and scrapbooking using Cricut and Silhouette cutting machines.   Sublimation printing for custom princess mugs, tumblers, water bottles, and royal home decor blanks.   Print-on-demand (POD) merchandise and commercial physical items for fairy tale apparel, boutique branding, and seasonal gift items.   Custom apparel creation for princess t-shirts, royal hoodies, canvas treat pouches, and custom party tote bags.   Princess event decor, royal birthday party invitations, greeting cards, wall art prints, and custom planner sticker designs.</p>",
